flowchart TD
    A[Chunk builder splits on UTF-8 code-point boundaries] --> B{Element or code point exceeds byte cap?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Raise UnsplittableValueError; do not emit an oversized chunk]
    B -->|No| D[Build WireEnvelope with HMAC authentication, CRC32, and metadata]
    D --> E[Receiver validates HMAC, CRC32, fields, count limit, and payload limit]
    E --> F{Message ID, sequence, and total are valid and stable?}
    F -->|No| G[Reject frame; receiver state remains unchanged]
    F -->|Yes| H{Sequence already buffered?}
    H -->|Identical payload| I[Ignore duplicate; do not refresh idle TTL]
    H -->|Different payload| G
    G -. guardrail: changing total_chunks or conflicting duplicate frames are rejected; no partial reassembly continues; identical duplicates are ignored and reassembly stays single-message .-> E
    I -. duplicate does not refresh session activity .-> K
    H -->|New sequence| J[Buffer frame by sequence]
    I --> K{Are all sequence indexes present?}
    J --> K
    K -->|No| L[Wait in memory; caller polls timeout, retry callback requests missing chunks, then full-buffer callback after retry budget]
    K -->|Yes| M{merge_mode}
    M -->|json-object| N[Parse object fragments and reject duplicate keys]
    M -->|concat| O[Concatenate UTF-8 payload bytes]
    N --> P[Return complete bytes and mark receiver complete]
    O --> P
    P --> Q[Create a new Reassembler for the next message]
    L -. no built-in timeout scheduler .-> R[Absent: transport or user authentication, scheduler, receiver observability]
